# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale ca
# (https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/47/supplemental/day_periods.html),
# transcribed in chronologia/dayparts.py as [13:00, 19:00).
# Sources: Gran diccionari de la llengua catalana
# (https://www.diccionari.cat/GDLC/vespre), which defines vespre as the
# "primeres hores de la nit" -- an early-evening band Spanish runs
# straight through with one tarde.
# Catalan opens the tarda at 13:00, after the hour-wide migdia, not at
# noon the way Spanish and English do.
tarda
